 r←Test_GETEndpoints url;GetEnv;api;c;d;e;ep;h;n;p;res;responses;t;url
⍝ Test that GET endpoints respond with appropriate HTTP status as described in openapi.json spec
⍝ FIXME add tests for endpoints with path parameters
 GetEnv←##.##.GetEnv
 res←#.HttpCommand.Get url,'/openapi.json'
 :If 200≠res.HttpStatus
     r←0
     :Return
 :EndIf
 api←res.Data
 (d n c t)←↓⍉0(⎕JSON ⎕OPT'Format' 'M')api   ⍝ Depth Node Content Type
 2{p[⍵]←⍺[⍺⍸⍵]}⌿⊂⍤⊢⌸d⊣p←⍳≢d     ⍝ Parent vector from depth
 ep/⍨←~'{'∊¨ep←n[p⌿⍨n∊⊂'get']   ⍝ Endpoints except those with path parameters
 responses←⍎¨¨1↓n⊢∘⊂⌸⍨(+\e)×(p∊⍸n∊⊂'responses')∧(⊢∨p∊⍸)⍣≡e←n∊ep

 h←##.##.##.HttpCommand.New¨'GET'⍨¨ep
 h.URL←url∘,¨ep
 res←h.Run
 r←res.HttpStatus∊¨responses
 :If ∨/0=r
     ⎕←(0=r)/'**TEST FAIL** '∘,¨ep
 :EndIf
 r←∧/r
